<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="19691231T185959" id="79b99e3f-5f52-4a53-bc97-6dbaddfa1cda"/>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Label="Scene 1" Type="Scene Info" id="d1924614-285e-4883-b626-1c0205fe0ff2">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">0. Spark</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6f9898f0-3916-43d8-a0ba-3d66794ec5c2">
      <SceneProperties Length="15" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CRYSTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MIMI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MIMI &amp; CRYSTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ORANGE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RAU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Forest, Southeast Asia</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text>A bird tweets and a lizard hisses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f7a2afa-107d-4a20-9353-c9235b3565b7">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text>, a myna bird, enter away from the stage. They search about until they get spooked at the sight of an </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">audience member</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5862cc40-8751-40b6-a78a-df954b0c7792">
      <Text>A campfire ignites in the middle of a dark forest. Every sound of nature is audible in the distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4d93943-53d1-431d-a17a-cec71359e9ed">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">1. Incipient</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f7a2afa-107d-4a20-9353-c9235b3565b7">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> swoops in onto the stage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a53e1f31-10d5-4f0e-8804-44a52d9388ca">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text>, a monitor, crawls out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c80e48d-61f3-4bd0-b7b2-714f866b856b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> performs a birdlike dance, symbolizing nobility. They mimic the sounds of nature.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5e7999e-9a53-45f8-836f-be5ea945952b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> expresses such power with their monitor presence. They mimic the surrounding environment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb610943-36d7-4140-9e22-586979f31783">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bc4e1a82-8356-4662-af54-20c58c4f0f73">
      <Text>Light at night. What a sight. 
Is this right? Night with light?

Night bequeathed. Sight to teach.
Right beseeched. Light in reach.

Night released. Sight to meet.
Right to seed. Light is heat-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="285a14f7-34fe-4c1d-a625-bc6155240ace">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> touch the fire, burning a wing or a leg.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="366b131c-46f6-459f-b6c0-b37fca892357">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c1ae347d-6d75-429c-bf1b-fdd72df9da73">
      <Text>Dead! Heated! Healing...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63e01d5e-99c4-41cb-b72e-9b3861510389">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> face each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4dbfec52-3830-4831-a392-cd2a22f99051">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="159f77ec-0747-4136-82e7-7fd806502b1e">
      <Text>Heathen! Where are my babies?! Where’d you hide them eggs? You seek mine, too? </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Mine</Text>
      <Text>?! My intentions are for you to give me your attention. Do you have an original thought, monitor lizard/myna bird?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="66607006-19a2-4f93-ad31-8bc1eb3c4e20">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8a0bf81-7083-42a6-8fa6-dca47fb233e6">
      <Text>I’ve settled here. Does that answer your question?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ac390bf-0e79-4744-a9d1-014974e902cd">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="279a4ee6-4a20-45ec-a69e-b2a1a1f4dd94">
      <Text>I’m a vagabond. Your answer settles not well with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9a4b685-debf-4c6f-b96d-c328c55e346f">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e61c602d-1a36-4322-9eb6-d58185d925f6">
      <Text>Well, a myna bird should never settle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8dd8aab-fb1d-4a74-b31b-f21981bc1812">
      <Text>MimI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="45d175cc-dbe9-4ce0-b04e-a50912622f4b">
      <Text>Eggs </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> be laid somewhere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="766b7f29-122d-4835-a114-0d7da1ffcd29">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="986a4a33-9e83-4287-9451-60358003f31c">
      <Text>Eggs should be laid where their ancestors laid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63ffc76a-9aea-4051-b87a-52d4f6dcf8c4">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="756c01ad-258a-4bf3-a139-55e880fb0faa">
      <Text>It does not make it right for you to hide my eggs!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a3f4309-24c8-4aa6-8713-6170049b5cf9">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9bc6fb2-5967-4e5a-ac67-62825af705d5">
      <Text>I hid no eggs. I am busy with mine, now missing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c31d5960-f79b-43aa-8ef6-2fe505cd7683">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="082c11ff-87cb-4022-b9ec-7f9bf3bfc569">
      <Text>I eat nothing but bugs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f3a829c-d1d7-417e-b325-9dc9d3e6a98a">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="802cbfe9-33c8-47ca-a121-d9e152d3556e">
      <Text>You’re more a snake than my own cousins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ecd814a4-955e-4e59-89f8-65c74bc1af69">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6782cf4e-f0b0-4a0b-b5f5-43f53f028862">
      <Text>And you have mouth for worms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="38a4aa59-c53e-49cf-8204-e0b92ee47e83">
      <Text>A firefly flies by </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b1a99a4c-d816-4aac-8281-0b81fc3ca308">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> catches the firefly in their mouth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e7a0c3a-75d4-435a-bdac-d23520561a83">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7e205a8-a3d9-43f6-a085-45f948cff6b6">
      <Text>My mouth worm is an efficient hunter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c186f071-13e3-4c92-9de2-52f6db214f03">
      <Text>A firefly flies by Mimi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9a70b363-37c4-4d3d-9c28-caca0ced21c1">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> tries to catch the firefly. Instead, they lead the firefly to being fried in the campfire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="450b1503-1407-4719-b0a3-3331d32fbd23">
      <Text>The firefly drops to a crisp on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6710e13-aa4e-4c68-b12e-eb5c8b72a163">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57c67ba5-9dec-437b-8e32-3ad561ed0908">
      <Text Style="Italic">I killed my meal without laying a feather</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="086f46bc-6b01-4aa3-9767-e787e2f3b219">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bab75054-51f0-4a7e-86e9-94da836976e9">
      <Text>Is that firefly even editable now?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3af9d594-8712-4dd4-801c-dd9d1c5c4eab">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> eats the fried firefly from the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f457c69-f7b3-49dd-88e9-eaf60de9ac89">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81f41bfd-c2e9-493f-9989-a542a77ca920">
      <Text>A firefly is a firefly for a reason.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5489fe6a-cb07-4ee0-a2ee-d8f39f826054">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> snatches another firefly and puts them into the campfire. They eat the fried firefly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e2c42d1-91fd-412e-964e-0402a5f531d0">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2974691-3657-4a1d-9686-25ed891573fd">
      <Text>Fire? Am I right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4109076-5e56-4164-aa43-06f646ddc032">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fe049ca6-f6ed-40c1-8517-9a7c0f03ff6e">
      <Text>What would be more right...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f750cce-0e0e-41bc-84fb-00213546564a">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> grabs leaves. They catch another firefly and fry it. Then with the leaves, they create a smore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="028e390a-f990-4ca0-b063-69439bb4352d">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="752a69ca-8462-4229-a357-bad1770869f8">
      <Text>Want... S... More?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1d91c933-6e7a-4e68-92ef-288a5979694a">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="530c6e0d-6527-4665-99cf-5ced34c63a6b">
      <Text>Smore...? Eh, smore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c3930c85-833f-4d49-a203-23156777d346">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc533881-db4f-4c32-a5f5-632bb6099997">
      <Text>I know you don’t have a worm for a tongue, but you can make your own worm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61db1c95-a20d-48d9-af6d-29a46821b4b6">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> hands </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> a branch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c90b7c0f-851b-4911-84b3-69ec92d8e6cd">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f41184fe-ef30-4c66-b59d-b5a02273ac98">
      <Text>Thank you for this olive branch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61db1c95-a20d-48d9-af6d-29a46821b4b6">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> grabs a branch for themself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e10ed27d-cfb4-4b4f-ba59-b855aa9bc985">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b160147-36bc-45e3-9212-33733495041a">
      <Text>You should not be the one to have all the fun.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="adece49f-3b34-4ae7-9fab-37cb59cc148b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> catch fireflies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4d93943-53d1-431d-a17a-cec71359e9ed">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">2. Growth</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d756368-79b0-4165-9129-28e410945892">
      <Text>The campfire progresses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d756368-79b0-4165-9129-28e410945892">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal </Text>
      <Text>sit by the campfire with fireflies on sticks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d75f4d1f-0883-4e60-a451-962b32ab3ed2">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a9dc637-5172-4de2-9827-a1717e3289e4">
      <Text>I have not eaten since I last touched the Sun.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c0b93ce2-1b84-453a-b68b-c7f849bc1ab2">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60a6ae1f-0f66-4382-90f2-3e102a8c5f2e">
      <Text>You get to touch the Sun?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8be26ae2-73b4-42fd-96bd-6c2b52679250">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30a8a242-29e4-461e-85c0-398a62b64248">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54733e46-23bf-4767-9f29-676f69542724">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="187e2010-9840-40fb-a340-0374b1a1daca">
      <Text>Flying must be fun.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="325041de-c09c-4719-95d5-e02821a3e505">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00341b95-5931-425e-ae48-19ff3354c951">
      <Text Style="Italic">Flying must be fun</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1d47588-5cdb-4a37-b66a-fd22a60087c4">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f602d98a-22cd-4b0c-8819-75104b4923a0">
      <Text>Pardon?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="315bc725-c914-4489-8ff0-14cf5ae133b7">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17be9505-491c-47aa-81ce-129881c74224">
      <Text Style="Italic">Pardon</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="42ecbd0e-a884-4862-a31a-6f47bb47a6d5">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0c53f7a-aec8-4643-9f4c-036488872f72">
      <Text>Give this a rest, you mocking bird.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0908c95e-d5ae-4eed-a3c0-d35ff31d4c1c">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0bee3ffe-cd07-496e-b35d-43e879181065">
      <Text>Resting on a tree is the life. I can do that, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c0a37088-b84f-4278-bf81-553319ef459e">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="472acd93-7376-4da8-b8dd-d07620d8cad6">
      <Text>Every time you speak, it’s always </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">me</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">me</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">me</Text>
      <Text>-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4450b3d4-fa18-43eb-acef-ba111f009bf5">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6f746c3-6507-4874-8e41-460d38e8e895">
      <Text>That’s my name: Mimi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="858c88f2-f39d-4083-96d5-4e20fffa0fe5">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b326ea06-deca-40b3-a10d-80583b867ec5">
      <Text>Mimi, you’re a smart </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">arse</Text>
      <Text>. Do you know how fireflies are able to light up their bellies?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> uses the campfire and their theatrical physique to represent the origin story of the fireflies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93c6fbb9-c244-462c-a334-8a6bcd7497f5">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1205f0de-eb5b-40cd-bd11-ebc7ee889d54">
      <Text>They say that the fireflies are the broken spirits of an enlightening creature.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ca7bbc1-2fe8-4d8b-a472-86640fce817b">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a2fe27e-d3e4-4f3e-bee9-0e39858264be">
      <Text>Who’s “</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">they</Text>
      <Text>?”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e12a319-705b-404e-9e52-ed7a19afee6d">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f575075f-9371-493b-8314-38e2a9ef0cb9">
      <Text>The tribal myna birds that I’ve encountered on my journey told me this fable.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="32e40120-7621-40af-9dcc-e0a2038f22c3">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d4e1ec36-fd2b-4ce7-bdb2-fc2b36e370bf">
      <Text>Mynas making up myths.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="67071731-0280-43e6-ab16-8dffde0a0228">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba1c03d4-fb9f-4ac5-b0ef-0da3841296ee">
      <Text>I wholeheartedly believe in spirits. This is no myth to me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="47017f1b-622a-4f58-95c1-42e2a04e01c7">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b500e67e-9016-40aa-a254-173d99550b80">
      <Text>Who is this enlightening creature?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3eefdc5-47fc-4467-9fbf-2423afd35da4">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3fb34e6-4749-4470-b160-3334a09fbc43">
      <Text>The brightest of them all. The creature that built the Sun, but they grew weary in the feat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="875811a5-9301-4412-a2e7-9770f05f7175">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e921f1d-5e3c-4e1c-be01-78a21cbe297c">
      <Text>Of course. The Sun’s sturdy so that you don’t break it when you fly into it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8af5020-976e-41b9-8a8b-e85380bcbb0a">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="73b5f9e4-7bbd-4b0d-a189-dc29caf93060">
      <Text>At least I can touch it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a887b0b1-164b-496c-87bf-53536f20c177">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e09a96c1-6aeb-48ca-b2ce-3c5ad8b079ce">
      <Text>Touché.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35db5985-8e86-4873-a044-b49ae300219c">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c722d036-622a-4cc9-bd1d-cc71f1a5c1ec">
      <Text>The Sun came to life. They are alive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f53f17b-96e0-49dd-9478-3bcd4144d8e5">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eb81b408-b29f-49b7-82c4-78320e304ba9">
      <Text>Oh... really?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="62774a3b-cb97-4191-a189-5a3bd67004f4">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a851bf9e-8939-4af3-b6ba-39aec36a64ca">
      <Text>This creature could not sleep. They could rest. They regretted making light that could not be turned off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="468d7b3d-839e-461d-a72c-f1627e41e368">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0999c0ab-4eb0-4880-bec9-c700c72eef63">
      <Text>I’d grow restless, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c5d1e9d-369a-49f2-8768-f0e030376751">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="871f66b0-7e3e-4e04-b400-9d4901b12082">
      <Text>The creature made a deal to the Sun. If the Sun rested for half the time, the source of light for the world would be this creature’s broken spirit known as “</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">the</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">fireflies</Text>
      <Text>.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21492fdc-616a-4711-b6b0-bf5fe015b2ea">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="131246fd-d01f-4504-a266-ca5b0a2d4fc9">
      <Text>So, why are we eating their spirits?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5ac16ca-642a-4cac-a3cf-c04047088014">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d360d85b-e6fc-42a3-a166-e1b2fd202c80">
      <Text>We’re not eating them. We’re sending them onto the path to the after-world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b8ff316c-c362-4c33-a3e2-4dc136328689">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94664ca7-429f-4165-9cf6-6a42b0d8b46d">
      <Text>Where they would assemble themselves?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3c1f176-2d66-4a17-8783-120b8b9d847e">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b676666-fe2f-402a-87a8-53b18368e60c">
      <Text>Maybe. Light does not replace others, but build upon one another.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e0b6ba6-01a6-43a7-ac40-36492bbf883d">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c32dec7-77a3-49dd-a142-822321c541c0">
      <Text>That’s the most sense you’ve made thus far.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccfc134c-5dfa-4669-a0d7-4e812cd5e301">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c0c2cf27-6bda-43c6-91b4-623e757b792b">
      <Text>You have no sense of curiosity for the meaning of </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">all this</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9603da1-4d39-456b-8200-ec2043eb7be2">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0328b844-5ede-459f-8dce-a7bd0f1267f6">
      <Text>I am pretty sure there is a scientific reasoning behind their light-up bodies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee8c6a43-6f19-41dd-862c-4e645a80e450">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ae4e9c97-b0e0-4b7e-b670-ce0d9572c4f1">
      <Text>And tree monitor, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">clearly</Text>
      <Text> it looks like you know the science. What do you call yourself?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd6ffad0-3479-4693-ba79-c9b5b3955d70">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4bf6c68d-41b0-4b12-864d-76f38bcd111b">
      <Text>Crystal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93a87074-da7f-4044-934f-1e8e676533a9">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="484778f6-2241-4a10-a0bb-7238c105c158">
      <Text Style="Italic">Wow</Text>
      <Text>, are you bright or is that your forked tongue of yours speaking?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccca2e4b-3b2c-4f65-8d14-3662c697a9ee">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83c6e029-ae4f-4074-9a82-3be8d74df408">
      <Text>Very funny. I was the last to hatch. I was a gem in an empty nest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ad60b17-c789-46f5-b507-21f16ac32e7f">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="449fa2ae-5260-4264-b5a6-c28e68a482f8">
      <Text>You had no one to pass on your history?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74153efd-5a7f-4d4b-be67-86c64108331a">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5b8e8bb-e38b-4f15-aee6-79d025015bc6">
      <Text>No story.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9d37d91-7b01-40eb-a58f-3c605d4eebc0">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96e0c1ff-869f-44bd-9a25-7079644c2a9b">
      <Text>What kind of life is that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="70f77437-c5fb-47ad-9814-48ae9cddd57b">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d240d47d-fb1d-49d3-8b0d-a82fb6b4974d">
      <Text>All I know is this forest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="614bd92b-026d-4f5b-98dd-c871c867234d">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d456bbd-8215-4d9a-b7dd-2484dc7fd828">
      <Text>Do you get out to the water often?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae400af1-a808-4535-a419-b012c13183dc">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce094ded-acc6-4138-9303-89e6861db802">
      <Text>I felt the rain. Isn’t that enough?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f68d8bcb-e870-4dee-b0fb-e3603628e1a6">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08635cb4-d92f-401b-a50d-8ad954ad0aff">
      <Text>But out there, there are other creatures who made a home out of the rain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e4e43807-d437-460b-b8f2-38da1d94857e">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b5f6d30-418f-42bf-a908-cb4dbd0d70b2">
      <Text>There are animals that can breathe underwater?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6d68fcf-41c0-4f88-b43f-396216cc6b74">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9bf364df-dbca-47bc-b8bd-87858d268a19">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de948ca1-fd56-4b8c-8f23-e09ebf6d240d">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3aa3db50-e531-460b-b749-d60befe7714a">
      <Text>I don’t believe in your fables.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63f03d3f-02f6-492d-b5ec-4fab06d7cfbe">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16a2034a-eba0-47b9-a3ba-96f4c11386f3">
      <Text>It’s true. They don’t have legs like us, but they have wings like me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3188b799-d37e-4953-8613-a14853454d2b">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="521b54b1-96da-4345-8bea-35e6e927f798">
      <Text>Can they fly?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5897c6bd-a959-49ad-b52f-0743b6ccee9c">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e25e535e-b54b-407a-841e-9809171f33f2">
      <Text>No, they are like me but use their wings to move through water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6090b624-eb8e-4c87-994c-e362649d91bc">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36a1aab8-5600-47c4-a510-c7e7b6ba23e2">
      <Text>I dreamt of flying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2ece63b-447d-4be3-af96-95ab25306572">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af71786a-be0d-4095-83a6-8b0ccddbc067">
      <Text>Then, try it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="73b82db7-b619-457a-8e02-6c8fdbafe1cb">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="27a8900c-1ab9-4b5d-958e-aeccad90f88c">
      <Text>If you’ve noticed, I do not have wings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c905b14-0d50-4580-b0dc-645bf0706687">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b71be56-e1ee-40dd-8ee8-3d7808bc6756">
      <Text>Build one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5fb5eb5d-629d-419b-ac40-a1d427844d10">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9f091c85-887d-487f-9811-af2a6589af23">
      <Text>The world is my oyster?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21a5b916-ceb1-40b3-bf4a-c662a94d8731">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec5e9242-43ec-4673-83a1-cec5bbcb365b">
      <Text>Well, at least your ancestors did not evolve into clam shells.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb823be0-7ca5-441d-9bff-5e13e2eeebce">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57729b38-a69a-489a-afd4-7fdfcbd50cc8">
      <Text>Your jokes are mollusks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a703acd-8b07-4000-8e1f-e3690479980b">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc4d9d94-fbb6-4888-a625-73081862b940">
      <Text>Wait, you said you don’t believe there are creatures who make homes in water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="26ee0732-bee9-4f7e-9bd3-548c44bfc95d">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd9a112c-e465-4b39-84e1-eb91dc529141">
      <Text>Oysters are not real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37e13773-065c-4d20-8a0d-2f116f6222e0">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04377d3f-bd1c-4274-ba71-df4dcc91368b">
      <Text>You’ve heard of them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0bf30c7-70f4-4c1e-980d-ae7892c04629">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="21506cb2-6dbd-41ec-aac2-800b52364c6e">
      <Text>Do you have something to say about the legendary oysters?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93208ce9-3b4d-47de-8e05-9ce0fd63c264">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="357adc64-7c6f-4442-a326-a0bc621bdf7a">
      <Text>I am paraphrasing but-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d210f25b-9c9d-435c-8b3e-29c5501895dd">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6282cf74-cd9e-4a5d-a8f8-f0fec6cdb725">
      <Text>You’re the king/queen of paraphrasing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6390518-f0cd-48ae-893f-da39f89a10e5">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc980f22-c7c7-4947-9b07-3dbe8ff077ed">
      <Text Style="Italic">You’re the king/queen of para-what-a-now</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f089a04-378f-4fd4-ad17-9bdb7e592450">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb4c2b37-a913-4017-ac31-1c666b3187f3">
      <Text>Your gold crest reminds me of a noble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ddde66c1-5570-4a07-bf81-2654587a8ff0">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c4770348-9860-4ea7-a55f-8045d4e2d27d">
      <Text>Your green scales remind me of grass. The ground that I do not have to walk on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12fd3751-be4c-45f1-8b32-24537ddb17fc">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f680fb48-926e-4721-a45f-0b3ed211dbbf">
      <Text>You certainly have the ego of a tyrant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a706a68-2367-410b-91c6-e8989a6b1665">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d6c2bc2-5a16-4f86-a7f6-a54dd9736ed0">
      <Text>I’m surprised your forked tongue has not gotten you to rant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0650ee1e-b5af-4cb5-a4c1-f9d394f86008">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6c5807c1-4b11-41f6-9fb1-5480894a9fcd">
      <Text>Looks like your ancestors devolved to losing your pearls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ef89337a-2588-40ce-a637-2d1bb49f1ab0">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="520b1178-07f3-4e66-80fb-029908e1a60a">
      <Text>At least, I had pearls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d756368-79b0-4165-9129-28e410945892">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> demonstrates their heirloom of any sort from their gold-crested myna family.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="be0d3f56-fc14-4b95-b0b1-66f23f86e1e9">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5d09d13-854d-4519-8782-6a3ae018df91">
      <Text>It helps when they’re heirlooms. But you make a bad parent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5707a7bd-c60f-427e-9621-6ac774701033">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f61d22f7-52fe-4a8f-bb51-69402c6b7b52">
      <Text>As a first-time parent, you’re not doing so well either.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e9b5638-7cfc-4721-ac5c-7db7d17dc568">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61048fa6-4a0f-428e-a25a-cab86f6b3669">
      <Text>Monitors do not typically monitor their own children. I’m the exception.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e352687-6d10-465d-9c6c-11dc5698fe1b">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26c87b01-a21d-41c9-847d-d96cb6300b02">
      <Text>You accepted hiding in trees all your life?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86ea05e1-1dee-444b-89c8-b0add3074a1f">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55f3e315-5a71-4ee3-a71a-3125baf01aed">
      <Text>Don’t birds do that, too?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5b51e76c-7d8c-40c8-b3fd-b9450e710e02">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d0b34b2-bcba-48f7-8cbb-26253a6ed2f8">
      <Text>I cannot hide in trees. I stick out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a7b9f2b7-1802-4014-ac07-d33ab5c0ddbf">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="621668d9-cf34-4c02-9c61-4a74bca27d8f">
      <Text>Like a branch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00bf8ec5-ae02-485f-bcfb-54dbcd69434b">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="362c915c-66ca-4af9-a841-9b61fc21b064">
      <Text>You tree lizards are so fascinating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e34ceed5-5ba4-4e54-ba0f-e25554ce348b">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59a1b35c-da41-4f17-acec-3683cb63476e">
      <Text>How so?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="209f0d82-c05b-4d27-85f7-adbd3eaee20b">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6a09ad9-1add-44b5-985a-4ac6172fc918">
      <Text>I would not be so grateful for my parents abandoning me before I hatched.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37aa2256-98aa-483d-96c9-d941bb6576cd">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb06a388-e403-47a7-a86e-ba0e428c0612">
      <Text>I’m always hatching an evil plan against them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44208fda-17dd-4519-b02a-1b700853b58b">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="56fa610b-4363-4fb8-b820-967f5692a858">
      <Text>I’m sure it will unfold some day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d82e36f4-a837-48ad-bef5-30830bb705c2">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48defe66-b767-45b6-844b-dd5355199774">
      <Text>Have you forgiven your parent?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e26ed7eb-024d-4878-9034-24862ae073a2">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cefa0869-34bf-4b16-83df-fcb97d6cc166">
      <Text>For what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e37ce2f-28fb-4f42-b4c6-cd665ee57215">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="216b4f58-aea8-444e-b942-4279ec4e1574">
      <Text>For feeding you puke. Literal vomit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f92577c8-e752-43d1-90b3-ebc5a8aa79f2">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3176528-8076-4d08-b5ff-306f8537ab64">
      <Text>Ew, never.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba77b60a-06fe-4d20-8e03-e1109b49cda5">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb3ca813-bd10-4321-b3f9-1004845d4a4c">
      <Text>Are you going to break the cycle?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="591cee89-3443-4046-939b-6bde52428427">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82f50481-1b81-4248-8915-67b9b3d8b750">
      <Text>Why would I if it has worked for generations?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf5da480-db43-4643-893a-a40abe21845e">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b2ac48dc-6afe-4755-b7d6-2a6b7a63bd07">
      <Text>What made you decide to be a parent?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9df2ac3e-7a24-4ff2-86b4-67d0a8e8f36a">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="616e0e59-7e01-4a78-940c-d9e6c0511917">
      <Text>Same as you I’m sure.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="885f6cdb-cefa-4ce3-83d0-9126da313bfa">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cdeeaf29-89ae-48fe-977b-57f647e8b246">
          <Text>Mimi</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="39712b88-a03a-46c4-9069-dff4d22fe440">
          <Text>To pass on my spirit.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2429265b-2bd7-4872-acae-45d5e86c96c0">
          <Text>CrYSTAL</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="532fd478-908c-4c6a-80d9-80a3dfa5965b">
          <Text>To pass on my blood.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80948b7a-e56d-4c21-974f-dc4bd3941f97">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d4e5f132-fa09-4ab6-88fe-bb6521ae3ae8">
      <Text>I know not of my parents’ spirit, so blood it is.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="67969488-3d80-4236-bc35-2cffd47b5b9e">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b538932d-f442-4f26-8639-3586f8d8120e">
      <Text>But no matter what, we are always a reflection of our parents.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4cd7353b-55e2-4340-a01f-6d8cbc007447">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a29f087d-0c30-4b7c-a0f3-de9878342767">
      <Text>Is copying your parents an offensive or defensive mechanism?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74ea5279-98b7-4d30-8433-649d71f67c0d">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0cabbd09-e5ed-41a8-ba7b-ae361931e82d">
      <Text Style="Italic">Is copying your parents an offensive or defensive mechanism</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df7dee16-833d-4562-a0c0-003db3c6f2df">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e63ae75-b8fc-4dad-b81d-257dee5d2eef">
      <Text>Copying me is definitely offensive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="261d9ea7-a31b-410d-b0ad-f4abe71e2bf6">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e90a5d9-6ca8-463d-a52d-eb839b30fedf">
      <Text Style="Italic">Copying me is definitely offensive</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa24b932-ddc4-4cb8-8c51-5111a61a8de8">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f6c93905-f4eb-40ac-84c1-aa36cb838d9d">
      <Text>Do you have an original thought or do you like mimicking everyone, Mimi?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b8c7181-3495-4722-8413-b734197436f5">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b3a15f89-6b33-4680-aea8-4a0968aaf0f0">
      <Text>Do you speak in anything other than forked tongue, Crystal?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="886290c3-78af-413b-8816-00ff9157629d">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b5a7886-2fbd-459f-9f47-b1b5871f330a">
      <Text>Go fork-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5d5bae6-40e9-4d2a-a034-e1fe508136e2">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c36f1c0a-4cfb-48f4-a477-972376663ba3">
      <Text>You go fork yourself!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="46f5d92d-3f43-4b3b-9aa6-6eb51ce05dd8">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e368897b-500c-4b35-84f6-648a6157cf8c">
      <Text>This forked tongue wished it had tasted your eggs!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dac1d426-a4a6-4e65-be14-c56ee48cc8a1">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93718315-ab9d-4690-9dcd-1cfc419df5bf">
      <Text>You snake!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20cd4dca-5900-418c-9883-676c63b3b3c1">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> paces around the campfire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b37ba1d2-1986-4b46-87ce-a747eb29b1f9">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ab1bde1-dea7-4cb4-a53e-77fd3a8827de">
      <Text>My feet walks on eggshells. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0de68623-3e1a-4c6b-b6c5-0db0d689e4ec">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="290944a9-2814-41da-87a4-ee98e350e7f2">
      <Text>Your attitude does not help.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="58f06664-6a5c-4997-8d67-23c53656c466">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="388a9992-3246-4ab5-a4d9-dbe20ac95a6f">
      <Text>Birds of a feather flock together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="782915ad-7358-4b96-b7e3-f12f3b915130">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="734f5240-cf9b-4953-b736-64fd66794fc7">
      <Text>You’ll never be a bird.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="965e2801-ea95-4798-a7ae-8040567a397f">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f504023b-bc30-4090-8126-feec0490286f">
      <Text>This lizard wants no gizzards for a stomach. I want something enlightening like a firefly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84057b58-09f5-4541-ae06-392e0d051bc0">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a947b3fe-3834-4b17-9a87-76a0f4f21076">
      <Text>You certainly have a fire in your belly. Stop dragging on. So you know where my eggs-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6efb0be7-c887-4454-8033-62d78dbfdc20">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8ed951a-dd9b-425c-b76c-de6374243263">
      <Text>Speaking of snakes, they are my reptilian cousins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="534695e7-2f1a-44e6-a4c1-a8dd0253aae0">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d41af32f-fa34-4f90-8136-4b6a3c20bbaf">
      <Text>There is a reason they have no legs to stand on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e016a57-f2fd-47e0-b57c-5bd28dcf9c31">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2dc70860-e765-4d71-8dae-d3c49554d53c">
      <Text>What contrived myth do you have under your wings this time?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ef9bf2c-c7e5-47b0-9ee3-80084964d51a">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="818c5ef3-5322-48eb-a104-82edd26b27f3">
      <Text>Legend has it that they lost their legs because they wished too hard for wings that they were not grateful for the legs they had.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="340ab44a-10df-4e5e-b92f-7c5c6c3199b4">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8ed951a-dd9b-425c-b76c-de6374243263">
      <Text>You’re definitely my evolutionary enemy. Prey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dfb6eedc-f2de-466d-9299-e828d82e9f9a">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72dc7b12-6d09-412e-874e-3b6b9bce8d58">
      <Text>Pray that you say nothing more foolish than this!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8639530b-bfc2-47ef-ba94-2ea6419e6ee3">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="676869c5-f7a7-429a-8dbc-374152921e15">
      <Text>I wouldn’t eat you even in your current pathetic state.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4bd1f3ba-d07c-4eb5-a0b9-580e1fefdcdf">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="071ec9fd-1869-484f-9993-fe9f282d404c">
      <Text>Forked tongue and flames in your stomach. I expect nothing more from a lizard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d744107-99ee-4663-a3a0-405aa445b6b5">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fc0a5f6-fea7-495f-a7c6-b257a6406aca">
      <Text>You’ve never really touched the Sun, have you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3769517-01f5-4eb0-945e-c02ac02e0535">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b51e441f-1576-4fab-809e-9d40a849879b">
      <Text>That Sun matters less with my sons. I cannot find mine and you’ll never hold yours if you don’t tell me where they are!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="85f388c0-9c29-4420-ba03-07f7eaa35794">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fdc7145d-4820-4798-90e5-25f84f159323">
      <Text>Egg me on! I pray that your own spirits are broken into countless pieces!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90ffc8ab-eab2-4ac2-9220-816c68e7122c">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a8bf8ae-60e5-4846-8483-bdd4a2799b7b">
      <Text>At least I have a spirit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7217fd50-8b5d-491c-8745-1a2423863e79">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tossle</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="308c4a23-11d6-4420-867e-d2c6fb4a04a5">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c88c397b-dfc9-4f7a-9e23-195b28a04cbb">
      <Text>Break my spirit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4d93943-53d1-431d-a17a-cec71359e9ed">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">3. Fully Developed</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e2576836-646c-4cae-b506-81d37c038aad">
      <Text>The campfire drops eggshells as it grows to maximum strength.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7217fd50-8b5d-491c-8745-1a2423863e79">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>walk</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>on</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>eggshells.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a266ff37-ca9a-4bb4-bf50-4d662eb34371">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="147a2136-7506-4ce5-9b43-8d01c573ccaa">
      <Text>Baby?! No-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6ef3901c-65e1-403b-a2f1-d79eef437e71">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> hold eggshells. As bird and lizard, they cry out for their dead children.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="188a7146-1fda-4188-bc04-df48a76a4dbd">
      <Text>The fireflies die out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="067450b6-f782-4823-8f72-72d8e6976a3f">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> wander about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08705be0-b084-4e30-8d86-1f3cb0bff7a0">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a2e26da-12d5-4031-9c52-9c67c1a07f41">
      <Text>The spirits of my ancestors... They end with me. They broke in hellfire!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="238b9aa0-5dc2-4762-a63c-829621237fde">
      <Text>The sounds are muffled by the distant sounds of humans.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b4947e23-ab02-4a85-90a4-ba095302b3a5">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a208c28-e5a1-4df1-babf-de6850a3949a">
      <Text>I first heard these sounds not too long ago. It was an unfamiliar tone. A language none of my neighbors in the ecosystem has ever spoken before. Hard to sit on. Tough to understand. None of our mother tongue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> uses the campfire and their physique to represent humans.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a67aa58b-f8f4-47ba-b633-a326b69fe2cf">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef1d21e8-8044-4e32-82b9-c410719f6929">
      <Text>They are the monsters’ tongue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b513e3d4-75c3-4861-bbe7-80468b911582">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3358a2e4-e51b-4dc9-a85e-2a7a9e6c2377">
      <Text>They sound too foolish to be.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e49df4b2-143e-4cb1-8aec-dec2469c0b54">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b04c656-4edf-4482-9eb6-3b30a0c4942f">
      <Text>As a hatchling, my mother/father once told me the tale of these two-feet beasts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e34758c4-8b31-4273-b1f7-fb4729f9056c">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca3a207d-bc72-4976-bc28-081b9b7fb707">
      <Text>So, monkeys?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30220633-3565-43b4-94c3-7005b0ab2633">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> pretends to be a monkey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1864200-3484-4dab-97e2-10bf72758ce3">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c45fc5ee-581e-4676-a3e7-c7d4362ed7ff">
      <Text>Listen. These beasts eat everything in sight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bd3dddc-46fa-44a8-bc18-510284f73d8b">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aeabfb70-466b-498d-b52a-be857580ca53">
      <Text>Impossible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f4533f98-98a7-4c5e-ad42-61bbc6740fb4">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7296c414-f5ff-4a13-9ac1-12871dec33e4">
      <Text>Evolution treats them as legends. They are the king/queen of the food chain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="42071b9b-5ca1-4546-a398-6572f918997e">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ca1fec1-01b5-4b03-98d1-a525c9bdec3c">
      <Text>My kind are the lords of this forest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f16996c-6433-4fd8-b510-9b9bd1729c7c">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b425206d-380a-49a0-8701-5d0933110d69">
      <Text>Rest assured, you’re a peasant’s meal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24d8cca3-7875-4b9e-a690-929a1ba3bf05">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bff2a7d0-1abd-4b3d-be28-d1fea9a78432">
      <Text>What sick parent raised you to speak to me that way?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a91aac75-6986-4b0a-b88c-f82b2341d212">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="546698c5-272f-4f7b-a9b6-b83eb61c27f5">
      <Text>A parent who never came back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e70807c-c219-4585-9683-b2ce81fa7d5a">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95942ce9-b56f-4b1e-ba0c-65c3d316a1cc">
      <Text>Where are they?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c11ae10-50c4-4007-abf0-a10203f73dbd">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="503a590d-898e-4124-a908-fda76e1fc6ba">
      <Text>No longer here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f348aa2f-68b7-4a1b-87f2-ba5fe39cd001">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eee2f337-f6d9-445a-a8d6-0b2e252b2759">
      <Text>Now spirits?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="baa88f58-f934-4333-b8ab-6b3824706a37">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="546698c5-272f-4f7b-a9b6-b83eb61c27f5">
      <Text>I could still smell their hot feathers, flesh as I flew high and above a village.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b724f8ff-ae57-412d-9114-64ae554d214f">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a2a5439-4ab9-42a7-acfa-b5ec808fa006">
      <Text>Village?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b8b454d-8727-401d-a801-b72ecfb00477">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d797f702-12e6-43ac-b8a9-1b4e0ee9faf1">
      <Text>The two-feet beasts’ nest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f2c8659-3c80-49cc-badc-00e1e07b019d">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c20b313e-4b36-40a0-b53e-1aea6f0310b0">
      <Text>You left your home?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0462ebe1-0f42-4983-b0a4-ac3553303269">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1bf8066c-49fe-44ff-a795-d8bbc358680f">
      <Text>I did not know how to fly the day before. My mom/dad could not teach me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b82a49d5-396d-46f5-82c5-5605e42af29d">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="934c90a5-8a5f-4544-beee-66723176d274">
      <Text>I was most fortunate to grow up alone and fight fire with fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1027c89-429c-45ff-a063-31b2486efb4a">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd8cba87-6f68-4d60-9c53-e01c60e64027">
      <Text>Why do your eggs matter now?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="544f32ce-1ad0-4346-90a8-c1bb24d8e47c">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8cf6c84f-8be8-4ca5-bdd1-434ff2ac9d27">
      <Text>I wanted to be different from my parents. The ones I’ve never met.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e30d101-1d6e-4a72-80b1-1c3ebb3b44ed">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2b8ce86-3a36-4a09-9b88-a448305d640b">
      <Text>You saw the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="306f3d29-d5a7-48b2-adf9-677a3b20274f">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ba94644-e99a-4eac-8d41-66d128b220dd">
      <Text>Your chicks certainly saw the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2a132951-5fb5-4de4-879e-e495f41eb0dd">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a17afe4a-ac5e-4fbb-853b-165dabd614f6">
      <Text>If only we could make light, of this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2cc6803c-c081-4f1a-82d2-b365a0389082">
      <Text>CRYSTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d1e7446-7991-4b38-ab9a-3a20c0413a39">
      <Text>The two-feet beasts. Those monsters!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="159a4571-dedc-4a32-a5db-c18aa4eaf92c">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97971839-e362-415f-97ad-113c8cf8b1ad">
      <Text>Unlike any other animal, they can make light everlasting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98f7b5aa-0a37-4cbc-9b91-1ecd544f48ee">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9fe39d93-9b99-439b-81f0-292e6c537c49">
      <Text>Mimi. Where does fire come from?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="636ece13-2855-4117-a754-b674f67bfbf9">
      <Text>MIMI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d0c22d5c-00c8-46ca-b45a-af2978138b2f">
      <Text>People.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12f4b1a4-297f-44a9-8dba-865fb67f996b">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b1795e6-927c-448c-a026-1c819fe64437">
      <Text>No. Really. Where does fire come from?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dce19f53-43c0-4404-995b-52eabac50f61">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a27ca620-1c04-4f62-a16f-46fc2d05f33b">
      <Text>The spirit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9c22672-aba4-4bbf-b62d-1547e72cae54">
      <Text>Mother nature speaks through the flora and fauna that is audibly expressing themselves in the darkness. The forest spirits are calling out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="188a7146-1fda-4188-bc04-df48a76a4dbd">
      <Text>Countless fireflies suddenly swarm the environment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="15c9e19f-472a-4cd6-8b2a-ee47f6812484">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> mimics the calls of every animal while </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> scales every plant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="015b897f-f9a0-4be7-adad-3ec357a43898">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> touches the campfire without burning themselves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98f7b5aa-0a37-4cbc-9b91-1ecd544f48ee">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9eaa052-4238-4fd3-980a-c0f1b1dca48b">
      <Text>We, too, can make light everlasting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="15c9e19f-472a-4cd6-8b2a-ee47f6812484">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> grabs a branch and makes a single torch from the campfire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text>Another campfire appears in the distance. Humans are audible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e1042a9b-d9b3-4df0-a358-4b24f2a2a2d3">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="510fdab5-7ec7-4692-b1a1-a50704d0c40b">
      <Text>The myths are true. This legend must end.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> gathers several branches and makes wings out of them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1fa78f2-bb7d-4f4b-ac3f-23ea377bcb93">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5e37f79-a8a2-41ee-9626-290195c9bd69">
      <Text>I cannot fly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> gathers branches and makes torches out of them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> plants </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> makeshift wings on </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text>’s back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a89bf432-c6bb-4673-bd20-5890c6c57fd9">
      <Text>Mimi</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="478cc877-fd13-42cc-8376-4555438eb09c">
      <Text>This will fly. It’s on you to spit fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5400aaa9-0acb-4fac-86b8-70a090bc590c">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> hands </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> the torches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a3840bd-d321-43e4-b7f0-f1833494e3cb">
      <Text>Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="115be425-f55e-488a-9f03-f6cc2905c171">
      <Text>It’s on you to hide your feathers and show the flames.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39ff7e70-9c64-450a-8330-55da5059a756">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> are ready to fight fire with fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e50c402-b8ce-4f7f-9543-ef2d8e6a3d62">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; Crystal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="863e0ac3-745e-4165-8a5f-38ddad1cb337">
      <Text>Let’s not make light of this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4d93943-53d1-431d-a17a-cec71359e9ed">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">4. Decay</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> hide in the shadows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text>Human shadows and silhouettes enter the space.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text>With shadow puppetry and flaming objects, </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> go on a rampage against the human invaders and quash them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f7a2afa-107d-4a20-9353-c9235b3565b7">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> fights with nobility like a phoenix.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="007ecb97-88c5-4aa2-b9f7-0a72d6e12286">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> wields power like a dragon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3302e9ea-e1ae-4475-aefa-18dc5401d7f5">
      <Text>There are audible human screams that cry out: “Fear!”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33dfcde2-b71f-49df-abaf-850f7868c07d">
      <Text>MimI (shadow)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="588d24e3-c2c8-4189-be4c-89c1057a9e68">
      <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5edba09a-e491-4f29-9237-cea67ae4ea0d">
      <Text>Fear me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f06eae0a-e392-4366-949d-4a6300e59eb1">
      <Text>Crystal (shadow)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37454d58-c95a-4a2d-84f0-f494d7235b8b">
      <Text>Drag on!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5249e2dc-1f81-41dd-b464-a910c63bd2c3">
      <Text>MIMI (Shadow)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e34a67dc-c79b-4820-b5c5-a9b7f19fb00c">
      <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cdd63e75-0735-4803-8cc8-bbf08c741bf4">
      <Text>Drag on?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ebc4cd30-743e-44b1-931d-862a23ffcd7b">
      <Text>There are audible screams that decry: “Phoenix” and “Dragon.” The humans will remember </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text> for millennia to come. The humans run away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="366b131c-46f6-459f-b6c0-b37fca892357">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; Crystal (Shadows)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="181ac412-9495-4e15-84de-1b2f0477dfc5">
      <Text>Nature is dead! Heated! Healing...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4d93943-53d1-431d-a17a-cec71359e9ed">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">5. Flashover</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb610943-36d7-4140-9e22-586979f31783">
      <Text>Mimi &amp; Crystal (Shadows)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="938a4d56-3206-47ec-8eb0-a97896036c6e">
      <Text>Light at night. What a sight. 
This is right. Knights of light.

Night bequeathed. Sight to teach.
Right beseeched. Light in reach.

Night released. Sight to meet.
Right to seed. Light is heat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text>The emblems of a phoenix and dragon are present.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f47da062-0e75-4d07-8399-fb14052f8705">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Mimi</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Crystal</Text>
      <Text>, as the Phoenix and the Dragon, run in and spook the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">audience</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97836a27-b12c-42cc-86c0-b1b5082d38b9">
      <Text>The campfires burn out. Blackout.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="307f9aa1-661f-41ab-b805-8c87422f8123">
      <Text>The Phoenix caws while the Dragon roars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="65ebd24b-46a5-4dc2-bc36-e9b625e8e8a4">
      <Text>End of Play</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

